TweetNaCl (Daniel J. Bernstein, Bernard van Gastel, Wesley Janssen,
Tanja Lange, Peter Schwabe, Sjaak Smetsers) is in the public domain:
https://tweetnacl.cr.yp.to/

Raven uses it in its license tools only (tools/license): Ed25519 signatures
and XSalsa20-Poly1305. It is not part of the Raven library.
